sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Parent
  participant T as Task
  participant C as Cleanup

  P->>T: create_task(work())
  Note over T: running, hits an await
  P->>T: task.cancel()
  Note over T: CancelledError is INJECTED<br/>at the next await point —<br/>not a flag you poll
  T->>C: except CancelledError: cleanup
  C-->>T: done
  T->>P: raise (re-raised)
  Note over P: cancellation acknowledged.<br/>The task tree unwinds.

  rect rgb(251, 233, 233)
    Note over T,P: IF YOU SWALLOW IT INSTEAD:<br/>the task reports success, the parent<br/>believes the work completed, and<br/>the server will not shut down.
  end
